\paragraph{Computational cost.}
On 350 paired PushObj tasks with a fixed ResNet, ECP adds 2.8\% per-replan latency but reduces replans by 12.4\%, lowering mean task-loop time by 12.1\%. Peak allocated GPU memory increases by 0.145~GiB. Recovery thus lowers average task cost despite the planning overhead (\cref{sec:cost}).

